{"id":"f16b26daaddf947e","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-no-uniform-nonzero-degree-list.md","title":"非零 c.e. 或 Δ₂ 度不能有效穷举","display":"cor-no-uniform-nonzero-degree-list — 非零 c.e. 或 Δ₂ 度不能有效穷举","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-no-uniform-nonzero-degree-list","aliases":["20-cor-no-uniform-nonzero-degree-list"],"display":"cor-no-uniform-nonzero-degree-list — 非零 c.e. 或 Δ₂ 度不能有效穷举","chapter":"7","section":"7.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 7.6.3 的结论","source_printed_pages":[161],"source_pdf_pages":[195],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting]]","[[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]","[[20-df-redeg]]","[[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]","[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","[[20-df-K]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-no-uniform-nonzero-degree-list"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-no-uniform-nonzero-degree-list</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-no-uniform-nonzero-degree-list — 非零 c.e. 或 Δ₂ 度不能有效穷举"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 7.6.3 的结论"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38ffff953003d9fb\" href=\"?note=38ffff953003d9fb\" title=\"20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting\">20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f2d2355efa286b3\" href=\"?note=4f2d2355efa286b3\" title=\"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join\">20-prop-disjoint-ce-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4ca35593c6aba92\" href=\"?note=d4ca35593c6aba92\" title=\"20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence\">20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec C\">\\(\\vec C\\)</span> 是统一 Δ₂ 序列且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall j\\ [C_j\\notin\\mathcal R]\">\\(\\forall j\\ [C_j\\notin\\mathcal R]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 为上游 c.e. 度族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"38ffff953003d9fb\" href=\"?note=38ffff953003d9fb\" title=\"20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting\">20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4f2d2355efa286b3\" href=\"?note=4f2d2355efa286b3\" title=\"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join\">20-prop-disjoint-ce-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d4ca35593c6aba92\" href=\"?note=d4ca35593c6aba92\" title=\"20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence\">20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}no\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}nonzero\\text{-}degree\\text{-}list}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\{\\deg_T(C_j):j\\in\\omega\\}\\ne\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\},\\\\\n\\{\\deg_T(C_j):j\\in\\omega\\}\\ne\\{\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D:\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}no\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}nonzero\\text{-}degree\\text{-}list}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\{\\deg_T(C_j):j\\in\\omega\\}\\ne\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\},\\\\\n\\{\\deg_T(C_j):j\\in\\omega\\}\\ne\\{\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D:\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=K\">\\(B=K\\)</span> 同时回避所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_j\">\\(C_j\\)</span>，得到不交 c.e. 分裂 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0,A_1\">\\(A_0,A_1\\)</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\equiv_TA_0\\oplus A_1\">\\(K\\equiv_TA_0\\oplus A_1\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 非可计算，至少一边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 非可计算。若给定度集合穷尽全部非零 c.e. 度，则有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_j\\equiv_TA_i\">\\(C_j\\equiv_TA_i\\)</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_j\\not\\le_TA_i\">\\(C_j\\not\\le_TA_i\\)</span> 矛盾。穷尽全部非零 Δ₂ 度更包含这个非零 c.e. 度，同样矛盾。任何统一 c.e. 序列都给出统一单调 Δ₂ 近似，所以普通有效 c.e. 枚举也被排除。无需为这一步额外证明两边都非零。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 7.6.3 的结论；印刷页 161；PDF 第 195 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"38ffff953003d9fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join","status":"resolved","id":"4f2d2355efa286b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d4ca35593c6aba92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"38ffff953003d9fb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting]]；see [[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-df-K]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-prop-disjoint-ce-join","status":"resolved","id":"4f2d2355efa286b3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","he